WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.849
Plan the service together during the week.

2
00:00:03.949 --> 00:00:09.433
In Setup, open Devices and press Pair a device.

3
00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:17.018
Enter the six-digit code on the other computer, and changes travel between your church's own devices, encrypted.

4
00:00:17.118 --> 00:00:20.527
The projection laptop already has everything when Sunday comes.
